The way to  Tambov University Hotel:

1) Plane to Moscow (Sheremetevo)
2) Bus from Sheremetevo to Metro station RECHNOJ VOKZAL.
3) Though Metro train from RECHNOJ VOKZAL to PAVELETSKAJA
4) From Railway station "Paveletskaya" though train to TAMBOV
( several trains at night)
5) Bus N 18 from Tambov railway station:
      2 stops to University administration building
      4 stops to University First building
      7 stops to University Hotel
      9 stops to Mathematics and Physics Department

P.S.
2+3) Another way from "Sheremetevo" to "Paveletskaya" is though bus.

